OL,3,GNEWSAMy bin hasn't been collected for 6
OL,4,Amonths - I want all my council tax
OL,5,Arefunded
OL,6,
OL,7,FA resident who has not had a bin
OL,8,Fcollection for six months since moving
OL,9,Fon to a new-build estate is seeking a
OL,10,F100% council tax rebate as
OL,11,Fcompensation.
OL,13,FBins finally arrived on Hawthorn
OL,14,FMeadows in Buckley, Flintshire, last
OL,15,Fmonth but Nathan Long and 60 other
OL,16,Fhouseholds can still only watch as
OL,17,Frefuse workers collect rubbish or
OL,18,Frecyclables from a nearby street.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
