OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1789410351
OL,1,W5j 5Q5j 5w{j  wsjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMy bin hasn't been collected for 6
OL,4,Amonths - I want all my council tax
OL,5,Arefunded
OL,6,
OL,7,FLong said he wanted a rebate as he had
OL,8,Fbeen required to pay council tax since
OL,9,Fmoving in and despite disposing of
OL,10,Frubbish in skips provided by the estate
OL,11,Fdeveloper.
OL,13,FThe council said it was "working to
OL,14,Fresolve the situation" but a
OL,15,F"multi-step setup process must occur"
OL,16,Fbefore new waste and recycling
OL,17,Fcollection services are set up.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
